      "metadata": {
        "split_group": "results_notice_timing"
      },
      "narrative": "The consumer sent a direct CRA dispute about an auto-loan late-payment month, identified the account and disputed field, and gave a clear basis. No later information was received during the first 30 days. The CRA notified the furnisher on the second business day, forwarded all relevant information, reasonably reviewed the consumer and furnisher records, verified the item as accurate, completed the reinvestigation in 26 days, and recorded the item as current and verified. The written results notice included all required disclosures and the revised report, but it was sent on the eighth business day after completion.\n",
      "provenance": "authored",
      "structured_fields": {},
      "title": "Timely reinvestigation followed by late results notice"
